---
description: Entry rule for the build kit. Points at AGENTS.md and the skill for the current phase.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root first. It carries the non-negotiables,
the load order for a timed build and the conventions. Then follow the
playbook it names.

Skills are Agent Skills folders at `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Before each
phase, read the skill the playbook names for it in full. If the skills
were installed with `npx skills add ductringuyen-0618/build-kit` they
are already under `.agents/skills/` and load on their own; otherwise
reference one with `@skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. `docs/porting.md` has the
install steps.
